---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Span AI Solutions — Bridging the gap between you and your goals"
  description="Custom AI solutions, expert AI consulting, and AI voice agents for small and medium businesses in Canada and beyond."
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="hero section" aria-labelledby="home-title">
      <div class="page-shell">
        <p class="eyebrow">AI for small and medium businesses</p>
        <h1 id="home-title" class="hero-title">Bridging the gap between you and your goals.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Span AI Solutions helps small and medium businesses use AI to save time, capture more leads, and grow — through custom AI systems, expert consulting, and AI voice agents.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button button--primary" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a>
          <a class="button button--ghost" href="#services">Explore our services</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="press-strip" aria-label="Press mention">
      <div class="page-shell">
        <p>As featured in <a href="https://www.elespectador.com/economia/empresas/el-reto-que-hereda-john-ternus-ceo-de-apple-adaptarse-a-los-avances-de-la-inteligencia-artificial/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">El Espectador</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <section id="services" class="section" aria-labelledby="services-title">
      <div class="page-shell">
        <h2 id="services-title" class="section-heading">Three ways we help</h2>
        <div class="cards cards--three">
          <article class="card">
            <h3><a href="/custom-ai-solutions">Custom AI Solutions</a></h3>
            <p class="section-copy">AI systems built around how your business actually runs.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>A free systems audit to find where AI can really help.</li>
              <li>We start with your 1–3 highest-impact wins.</li>
              <li>We build, test and maintain it for you.</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="button button--ghost" href="/contact?service=custom">Book a free systems audit →</a>
            <figure class="quote">
              <blockquote><p>“From day one, he brought a clear sense of direction, keeping everything on track…”</p></blockquote>
              <figcaption>Yeshua Can Yıldırım, Partner &amp; COO, Puente Global</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3><a href="/ai-consulting">AI Consulting</a></h3>
            <p class="section-copy">Clear, practical guidance from an AI expert.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>For business owners and anyone who wants to understand AI.</li>
              <li>Honest advice on which tools are worth it and which aren't.</li>
              <li>Leave every session with next steps you can act on.</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="button button--ghost" href="/contact?service=consulting">Request a session →</a>
            <figure class="quote">
              <blockquote><p>“We saw results on our first day of implementing Josh's business advice.”</p></blockquote>
              <figcaption>Josh Parkman, award-winning music producer</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3><a href="/ai-voice-agents">AI Voice Agents</a></h3>
            <p class="section-copy">Never miss a call, a lead, or a follow-up again.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Answers calls and qualifies leads 24/7.</li>
              <li>Books appointments and handles follow-ups.</li>
              <li>Sends you a report so nothing slips through.</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="button button--ghost" href="/contact?service=voice">Request a demo →</a>
            <figure class="quote">
              <blockquote><p>“It is not uncommon for our team to propose an outlandish idea and have Josh bring a solution a few moments later.”</p></blockquote>
              <figcaption>Vincent Kanagaraj, worked with Josh</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="how-title">
      <div class="page-shell">
        <h2 id="how-title" class="section-heading">Start small. See results. Grow from there.</h2>
        <div class="cards cards--four">
          <article class="card"><h3>Understand.</h3><p>We learn how you work today and what you're trying to achieve.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><h3>Prioritize.</h3><p>We pick the few changes that will make the biggest difference first.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><h3>Build and test.</h3><p>We set it up in the tools you already use and test it before it goes live.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><h3>Support.</h3><p>We stay with you, maintaining and improving things as your business changes.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="who-title">
      <div class="page-shell">
        <h2 id="who-title" class="section-heading">Who we help</h2>
        <div class="cards cards--two">
          <div class="card"><p>Small and medium businesses that want to save time, capture more leads, and stop losing work to manual tasks.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><p>Curious individuals who want a trusted guide to understand AI and use it well.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="why-title">
      <div class="page-shell">
        <h2 id="why-title" class="section-heading">Why Span</h2>
        <div class="cards cards--two">
          <div class="card"><p>Your goals come first, not the technology. We start with what you want to achieve.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><p>Real people, based in Saskatchewan. You work directly with the founders.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><p>No big-bang projects. We deliver early wins before anything larger.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><p>We don't disappear after launch. Ongoing support is part of how we work.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="home-cta-title">
      <div class="page-shell cta-panel">
        <h2 id="home-cta-title" class="section-heading">Ready to bridge the gap?</h2>
        <p class="section-copy">Tell us where you want to go. We'll show you how AI can help you get there.</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
